---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="How the Toteally Sisters website handles your information.">
  <section class="section legal-page">
    <div class="legal" data-fade>
      <h1 class="h-xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-lg">This policy explains what information this website collects and how it is used.</p>
      <p class="updated">Last updated November 2026</p>

      <h2>Information you provide</h2>
      <p>When you fill out a form on this site, we receive the information you choose to submit. We use it only to respond to you and to stay in touch about Toteally Sisters.</p>

      <h2>How it’s shared</h2>
      <p>We don’t sell or rent your information. It is shared only with the service providers that host this website and deliver form submissions to us, and only for that purpose.</p>

      <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
      <p>This website doesn’t use advertising or tracking cookies. Our hosting provider may keep standard technical logs, such as IP addresses, for security and performance.</p>

      <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
      <p>This site links to other websites, such as social media and partner organizations. Their own privacy policies apply when you visit them.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can ask us to update or delete information you’ve submitted at any time by contacting us through our social media.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date above shows the latest version.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal-page { background: rgb(235 186 217 / 0.24); }
  .legal { max-width: 800px; margin-inline: auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 30px; padding: 60px; }
  .legal :global(h2) { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; font-size: var(--h-sm); line-height: var(--h-sm-lh); letter-spacing: -1px; margin-top: 40px; }
  .legal :global(p), .legal :global(li) { font-size: 18px; line-height: 28px; margin-top: 12px; }
  .legal .text-lg { margin-top: 20px; font-size: var(--text-lg); line-height: var(--text-lg-lh); }
  .updated { color: #555; font-size: 15px !important; }
  .legal :global(ul) { padding-left: 1.2rem; }
  @media (max-width: 767px) { .legal { padding: 30px 20px; border-radius: 20px; } .legal-page { padding-inline: 20px; } }
</style>
